(142: (meta: (t: semantic) (n: 1) (term: string%20value) (def: %2F%2F%21%20The%20native%20executor%20of%20the%20grammar%20feature%20union%2C%20the%20Rust%20port%20of%0A%2F%2F%21%20%60js%2Fsrc%2Fgrammar-runtime.js%60.%0A%2F%2F%21%0A%2F%2F%21%20Compile%20a%20grammar%20once%2C%20then%20parse%20sources%20into%20lossless%20concrete%20syntax%0A%2F%2F%21%20trees.%20Loading%20%28%60load.rs%60%2C%20%60compile.rs%60%29%0A%2F%2F%21%20resolves%20imports%2C%20macros%20and%20parameterized%20rules%20and%20checks%20every%0A%2F%2F%21%20scanner%2C%20action%20and%20predicate%3B%20the%20executor%20%28%60executor.rs%60%2C%20%60rules.rs%60%29%0A%2F%2F%21%20runs%20it%20within%20explicit%20resource%20limits%3B%20%60tree.rs%60%20copies%20and%20renders%20the%0A%2F%2F%21%20result.%20docs%2Fgrammar%2Ffeature-union.md%20is%20the%20specification%20both%0A%2F%2F%21%20runtimes%20follow.%0A%0Amod%20attributes%3B%0Amod%20compile%3B%0Amod%20executor%3B%0Amod%20expectation_requests%3B%0Amod%20field_range_source%3B%0Amod%20forking%3B%0Amod%20grammar_selection%3B%0Amod%20joins%3B%0Amod%20keyword_lexing%3B%0Amod%20lexical_cache%3B%0Amod%20lexical_cache_memory%3B%0Amod%20lexical_election%3B%0Apub%28crate%29%20mod%20lexical_kernel%3B%0Amod%20lexical_plan%3B%0Amod%20lexing%3B%0Amod%20load%3B%0Amod%20mapped_tree_validation%3B%0Amod%20operations%3B%0Amod%20ordering%3B%0Amod%20parting%3B%0Amod%20precedence%3B%0Amod%20precedence_contexts%3B%0Amod%20program%3B%0Amod%20reducing%3B%0Amod%20repetition%3B%0Amod%20results%3B%0Amod%20roots%3B%0Amod%20rules%3B%0Amod%20selection_source_mapping%3B%0Amod%20separators%3B%0Amod%20text%3B%0Amod%20token_conflicts%3B%0Amod%20token_ranks%3B%0Amod%20tree%3B%0Amod%20walk%3B%0A%0Ause%20std%3A%3Acell%3A%3A%7BCell%2C%20RefCell%7D%3B%0Ause%20std%3A%3Acollections%3A%3AHashSet%3B%0Ause%20std%3A%3Afmt%3B%0Ause%20std%3A%3Arc%3A%3ARc%3B%0A%0Apub%20use%20grammar_selection%3A%3A%7BGrammarSelection%2C%20GrammarSelectionAlternative%7D%3B%0Apub%20use%20load%3A%3AGrammarRuntimeError%3B%0Apub%20